// phegdk.mmp -- OURS: GDK 2.24.33 (LGPL 2.1+) core + the Symbian backend (os/src/gdksymbian) as one replaceable DLL, app-private under a new name. Code = prebuilt archive libphegdk.a
// (recipes/build_gdk_x32.sh, build_gdk_backend_x32.sh, package_x32.sh); the WSERV thread (session, window, bitmap, event pipe) is phegdk_ws.cpp, compiled here. Exports = phegdk.def (gen_defs.py).
TARGET			phegdk.dll
TARGETTYPE		dll
UID				0x1000008d 0xE7015781
CAPABILITY		all -tcb
VENDORID		0
EPOCALLOWDLLDATA
EPOCHEAPSIZE	0x100000 0x4000000
OS_LAYER_SYSTEMINCLUDE_SYMBIAN
OS_LAYER_LIBC_SYSTEMINCLUDE
SOURCEPATH		.
SOURCE			phegdk_ws.cpp
LIBRARY			euser.lib ws32.lib gdi.lib fbscli.lib libc.lib libm.lib libpthread.lib pheglib.lib phegobject.lib phegmodule.lib phegthread.lib phegio.lib phepng.lib phepixman.lib phefreetype.lib phefontconfig.lib phehb.lib phecairo.lib phepango.lib phepixbuf.lib
SMPSAFE
